    "detailed_description": "VIRAL MULTIPLAYER<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA Survival Third Person Shooter in which the survival players have to survive in order to win. The Viral players have to infect the survivors to win.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMultiplayer and Single Player<br />\r\nThe survivors spawn with a gun and the ability to drop a bomb.<br />\r\nAfter the match countdown one of the survivors becomes viral and has to try to infect all of the survivors which will then also become infected and will hunt survivors.<br />\r\nThis game drops you right into action!<br />\r\nSeveral Fun and Challenging Maps and Biomes<br />\r\n3rd person shooter mechanics/gameplay<br />\r\nViral vs Survivors (Survive against the viral players for as long as possible)<br />\r\nCountdown, Spawning, Gameplay, Winner announcement, Repeat<br />\r\nMain menu<br />\r\nMultiplayer session setup (Steam Online SubSystem) Host, find &amp; join games<br />\r\nShooter mechanics<br />\r\nReloading mechanic<br />\r\nExplosive dynamite bomb<br />\r\nRespawn system<br />\r\nRagdolling<br />\r\nWell Optimized<br />\r\n<br />\r\nand much more\u2026",
